浮在空中，凤凰灵冠在她周围旋转；（5）俯视视角，幽灵般的凤凰盘旋成螺旋状；（6）特写，双手结印，微型透明凤凰显现；（7）凤凰灵体视角，透过薄雾般的羽毛注视着她；（8）灵魂融合变身，半透明的翅膀从她背后迸发而出；（9）终极魂爆高潮，凤凰粒子消散。所有分镜都保持了角色的一致性。设计中，凤凰是半透明的幽灵实体，内部散发着紫色光芒，能量脉络清晰可见，风格为暗黑奇幻武侠风，运用戏剧性的电影级光影，营造出神秘氛围，并提供角色参考图。", 1701630077, "randomize", "16:9", "2k", "Third-party", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 45, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "resolution"}, "shape": 7, "name": "resolution", "label": "resolution", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "resolution"}, {"widget": {"name": "channel"}, "shape": 7, "name": "channel", "label": "channel", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "channel"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error",